Package: precommitr
Title: Shared Pre-Commit Hooks for R Analysts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Quinten",
           family = "Sandberg",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "quinten.sandberg@hotmail.com")
Description: A small wrapper around the 'pre-commit' framework that ships an
    opinionated, organisation-wide configuration for R projects. Provides one
    function, use_precommits(), that copies the shared .pre-commit-config.yaml
    into a repository and installs the git hooks so every analyst in the team
    runs the same checks (styler, lintr, parsable-R, no-browser, no-debug, plus
    common hygiene hooks) before each commit.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    precommit (>= 0.4.0),
    fs,
    cli
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/quinten/r-package-precommits
BugReports: https://github.com/quinten/r-package-precommits/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
